      ["Sync with Dagu Cloud →", "/docs/cloud-sync/"],
      ["Project sharing →", "/docs/sharing/"],
    ],
    enterprise: "Larger team, or a rollout with support? Descarty ↗",
    filmLabel: "Kitewell film, 89 seconds, narrated",
    filmLink: "Watch the Kitewell film.",
    filmCaption: ["89 seconds · Narrated · Captions", "Kitewell's own screens with sample data; the client, its supplier portal, Ledger, and the team chat are made up"],
    transcript: "Read the film's narration",
    scenes: [
      [
        "A lot of the work people want automated lives on their computer: behind a sign-in, in an app with no API, in an Excel file.",
